{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119071447420-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119093516\"/><p>特朗普專車離開下榻酒店前往APEC會場。（電視畫面）</p><p>亞太經合組織（APEC）第33次領導人非正式會議周四（19日）將在深圳福田香蜜湖的深圳國際交流中心舉行，會議主題為「建設亞太共同體，促進共同繁榮」。與會的美國總統特朗普早上9時30分左右抵達會場。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:43:54.142923+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T23:14:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T01:37:30.337768+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T01:37:30.337768+00:00","content_hash":"0ba141a8b740515d03394e4daaedcef302ffd091b1298855c736358a7d9ec80e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}